# Unity SmartMerge (UnityYAMLMerge) is TEMPORARILY DISABLED.
#
# Why: git hands merge drivers extensionless temp files, so UnityYAMLMerge cannot
# match its own extension rules in mergespecfile.txt. It therefore falls through to
# the "*" fallback tool list, and if none of those third-party tools is installed it
# aborts the ENTIRE merge with an opaque error naming only a temp filename - it never
# says which repo file it choked on. That makes conflicts impossible to diagnose.
#
# With these lines commented out, git uses its built-in text merge and writes normal
# conflict markers. Messier to read, but it names the files and shows the hunks.
#
# To re-enable once a fallback merge tool is configured in mergespecfile.txt,
# uncomment the two lines below. Do NOT widen beyond scenes and prefabs.
#
# *.unity   merge=unityyamlmerge
# *.prefab  merge=unityyamlmerge
